: "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XoWG3Pu_1DYQ7kNvwEP5yhS&_nc_oc=Adr7bPZvnoMI6Sw4X8JxUvZ4RDlMj_GYqcgoMXgZEyf7tI_Q5L2W1wyXFQDzBhb-OGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1YfswLWuyuVwLwIJ9GCKLkL6mB5__O1WSlt9Wj163C0g&oe=69F20D89"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wa-fx_qF24kQ7kNvwHuY6_e&_nc_oc=AdqeamwlzY3YQ8z_NcMz74pBqZC3ZF2vsltdhNfJkAhQNSfg4Lz4uod-y6sLX4w9GiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2yG8j5EQTGFRUGVqcBB8qqSc9ha9OMaozTFqH0MA4DDg&oe=69F20BBD"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031361_1498865310806544_8225324080290249197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cJ7PiYmhazUQ7kNvwEGNI56&_nc_oc=AdrUEl9vWY4B6Pn1R8L1w7Zkz